@startuml C4-Code-Domain-Model
!include style-zinc.puml

title Code diagram (C4) — FinPulse domain model (by business domain)
hide empty members

legend right
  |= Stereotype |= Meaning |
  | <<Abstract>> | Mapped superclass base |
  | <<AggregateRoot>> | Consistency boundary; access via root |
  | <<Entity>> | Identity + lifecycle; private ctor + factory |
  | <<ValueObject>> | Immutable; equality by value |
  | <<Enum>> | Enumerated value object |
  | | |
  | **Associations** | Composition = ownership; arrow = reference |
  | **Preferred Terms** | See docs/Glossary.md |
endlegend

note as N_LAYERS
  controller → service → domain ← infra
  domain = model (entities, aggregates, value objects, enums)
  + repository (Spring Data Repository ports) only.
  JPA mapping lives on domain.model; no domain.vo package.
  Kernel: Domain Kernel package below.
  Preferred Terms: docs/Glossary.md
end note

' ── Domain Kernel ──────────────────────────────────────────
package "Domain Kernel" as pkg_base {
  class AbstractEmbeddable <<Abstract>> {
    implements Serializable
  }
  class TypedId <<ValueObject>> {
    @Embeddable Lombok class, e.g. PortfolioId
    +value: UUID
    --
    +{static} generateId()
    +{static} parseId(text)
    +{static} createId(value)
  }
  class AbstractImmutable <<Abstract>> {
    implements Persistable, Serializable
    +id: IdT
    +createdAt: Instant @CreationTimestamp
    --
    +isNew(): Persistable
  }
  class AbstractEntity <<Abstract>> {
    +updatedAt: Instant @UpdateTimestamp
    +version: Long
  }
  class Money <<ValueObject>> {
    +amount: BigDecimal
    +currency: CurrencyCode
    --
    +{static} createMoney(amount, currency)
  }
  class CurrencyCode <<ValueObject>> {
    +code: String
    --
    +{static} parseCode(code)
  }
  class Symbol <<ValueObject>> {
    +value: String
    --
    +{static} createSymbol(value)
  }
  class Quantity <<ValueObject>> {
    +value: BigDecimal
    --
    +{static} createQuantity(value)
  }
}

AbstractEmbeddable <|-- TypedId
AbstractImmutable <|-- AbstractEntity
TypedId --> AbstractImmutable : embedded id
Money --> CurrencyCode

' ── Auth ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
package "Auth" as pkg_auth {
  class Session <<Entity>> {
    +id: SessionId
    +customerId: CustomerId
    +token: String
    +expiresAt: Instant
    --
    +{static} createSession(customerId, token, expiresAt)
    +isExpired()
  }
  class SessionId <<ValueObject>> {
    +value: UUID
  }
  class UserCredential <<Entity>> {
    +id: CredentialId
    +customerId: CustomerId
    +email: String
    +passwordHash: String
    --
    +{static} createCredential(customerId, email, passwordHash)
    +updatePasswordHash(passwordHash)
  }
  class CredentialId <<ValueObject>> {
    +value: UUID
  }
}

Session --> SessionId
Session --> CustomerId
UserCredential --> CredentialId
UserCredential --> CustomerId

' ── Customer ───────────────────────────────────────────────
package "Customer" as pkg_customer {
  class Customer <<AggregateRoot>> {
    +id: CustomerId
